\section{Adoption of Agenda}
President Luke Yackley opened the meeting with a motion to adopt the agenda. The motion passed unanimously.

\section{Introduction of New Staff}
The president departed from the agenda, calling David Denton to the podium to introduce three new employees. David introduced Branden Zumbrun, Director of Facilities, Kenya Rock, Environmental Service Supervisor, and Doug Gardner, IT Manager.

\section{Tellers’ Report and Chair’s Declaration of Election Results}
Tom Scheurich, chair of the Nominating Committee, conducted the process of electing wing representatives.  The committee's slate was elected unanimously:
\begin{itemize}
	\item Wing A, Liz Masterson;
	\item Wing B, Walt Brooksbank;
	\item Wing C, Weezie Brown;
	\item Wing D, Linda Compton;
	\item Wing E, Barbara Siciliano;
	\item Wing F, Spence Lieske;
	\item Wing G, Steve Lakner.
\end{itemize}

