\section{Report of the Council}
President Luke Yackley presented the ``Motion to Amend the Bylaws---Consolidation of Environment/Landscape and Sustainability Committees.'' The motion appears in Appendix \ref{app:motion}, page \pageref{app:motion}. It was ratified unanimously.

