\section{Executive Director's Report}
Executive Director David Denton's report appears in Appendix \ref{app:director}, page \pageref{app:director}.

\section{New Business}
\subsection{Awards}
President Luke Yackley introduced the Extraordinary Service Award and the Legacy Award.
\begin{enumerate}
	\item Rich Compton took the floor to present the Extraordinary Service Award to Bob Stern.
	\item Claire Ross\'{e} took the floor to present the Legacy Award to Jerry Kahan.
\end{enumerate}

\subsection{Comments/Questions from the Floor}
One question from the floor was raised.
\begin{description}
	\item[Priorities.] A resident raised concern about the prioritization of the renovation plan over urgent maintenance issues.  The response emphasized the importance of ongoing maintenance and renovations and encouraged residents to address specific concerns through the Building Maintenance Committee and other available avenues.
\end{description}

\section{Adjournment}
Chair Luke Yackley adjourned the meeting at 3:30 p.m.

